92
00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.840
culture, and experience. Idea two, the biocultural approach.

93
00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.420
Refuse the question nature versus nurture.

94
00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:52.400
Epstein says it plainly. The broad truth is always that it's

95
00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.720
