social fact, not a biological unit.

106
00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:31.480
Genetic variation between human beings is absolutely real.

107
00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.860
Discreet biological races are not. Most human

108
00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:38.980
genetic diversity is inside Africa. Once you hold that, the

109
00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.200
standard story about a black athletic gene

110
00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:44.960
falls apart. Even though specific traits with specific histories

111
00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.180
really do cluster in specific

112
00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:52.320
populations. Idea five, sport reflects power and also reproduces

113
00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:55.700
it. Gender, race, class, and nation

114
00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:59.080
become visible in sport, and sport can make them harder to

115
00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.760
challenge. The syllabus puts it as a pair of

116
00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:06.000
tensions. Sports can enrich or stifle individuals, and sports

117
00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.200
can oppress or liberate social groups.

118
00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.820
One more thing to have in your pocket. This is an exploratory

